                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip2:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 海龟鳞甲" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="鳞甲意指鳞片状的生物板甲，现实中有许多生物都有自己的鳞甲结构，例如鳄鱼表皮上的突起物。对海龟而言便是构成龟壳的大板块。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 毒树脂" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="“对以上的注释：这些词很好，但我找不到它们的用途[G]。点赞、评论并订阅！我们下次再见，拜拜！”（Comment on ^: These are nice, but I can&apos;t find a use for them [G]. Leave a like, leave a comment, and subscribe!, and see you in the next one, bye!）" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 哭泣的黑曜石" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="开发者认为向传送门投掷黑曜石或雷击黑曜石来获取哭泣的黑曜石很有趣，然而最终为拓展以物易物的用途而放弃了该特性。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,4"
                                   Text="· 被火点燃后在附近随机传送，也是哭泣的黑曜石被弃用的特性之一。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
